### Dashboard summary
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/dashboard/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Upload document
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="patientId"

123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

LAB_REPORT
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="report.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Sample lab report content
--boundary--

### List documents
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/documents?patientId=123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Queue notification
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "type": "APPOINTMENT_REMINDER",
  "recipientEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
  "subject": "Appointment reminder",
  "body": "Your appointment is coming up."
}

### Send pending notifications
POST http://localhost:4000/api/v1/notifications/send-pending
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Audit logs
GET http://localhost:4000/api/v1/audit-logs?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
